				<div class="entry-content">
			<iframe src="http://www.youtube.com/embed/qtNj7DWZF1Q?rel=0" frameborder="0" width="530" height="350" allowfullscreen></iframe>
<p><a href="http://www.roblox.com/Stranded-place?id=1710162"  target="_blank">Stranded by Crazyman32</a> is one of the most advanced adventure games on ROBLOX today. Even in its alpha stages this game is a pinnacle of game design and scripting. Be sure to <a href="http://www.roblox.com/Stranded-place?id=1710162"  target="_blank">check it out</a>.<!-- PHP 5.x --></p>
