	<article id="post-6603" class="post-6603 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-news category-reports-from-robloxia">
		<header class="entry-header">
						<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="http://community.roblox.com/archives/6603" title="Permalink to Meet an Interesting ROBLOXian: Sheeppie" rel="bookmark">Meet an Interesting ROBLOXian: Sheeppie</a></h1>
			
						<div class="entry-meta">
				<span class="by-author"><span class="sep"> By </span> <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="http://community.roblox.com/archives/author/reesemcblox" title="View all posts by ReeseMcBlox" rel="author">ReeseMcBlox</a></span></span> - <time class="entry-date" datetime="2011-12-26T09:18:21+00:00" pubdate>December 26, 2011</time>			</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
			
						<div class="comments-link">
				<a href="http://community.roblox.com/archives/6603#respond" title="Comment on Meet an Interesting ROBLOXian: Sheeppie"><span class="leave-reply">Reply</span></a>			</div>
					</header><!-- .entry-header -->

				<div class="entry-content">
			<p>Meet <a href="/p/User.aspx"  target="_blank">Sheeppie</a>! This player is one of the most successful entrepreneurs ever on ROBLOX. He has become rich and famous by creating high quality uniforms selling them at reasonable prices. Many groups come to him for custom uniforms of all ranks and styles.</p>
<p><strong><img class="size-full wp-image-6608 alignleft" title="Sheeppie" src="http://community.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/12/Sheeppie.png" alt="" width="150" height="200" />Why do you play ROBLOX?</strong><br />
I play ROBLOX because of the level of customizability you can have with places and avatars.<br />
<strong>What is your favorite thing to do on ROBLOX?</strong><br />
My favorite thing to do on ROBLOX is to create outfits and clothing for the player community.<br />
<strong>Where do you get your ideas?</strong><br />
I browse the Internet looking at outfits from games. When I see something cool I make it on ROBLOX.<br />
<strong>What do you want your fellow ROBLOXians to know about you?</strong><br />
I want all my fellow ROBLOXians to know that I enjoy helping others. I enjoy reading, going to the movies, and playing many video games.<br />
<strong>Tell us something funny or cool that happened to you recently on ROBLOX.</strong><br />
Recently my brother has started playing ROBLOX with me, and thanks to the new private servers we have been building a sort of collage of many things such as a castle with a UFO bunker under it.<br />
<strong> What do you think your career will be?</strong><br />
 I want to be a professional graphic designer.</p>
<p><strong>Sheeppie&#8217;s Stats</strong><br />
Membership Type: OBC<br />
Member Since:  March 2008<br />
Visits: 46,119<br />
Knockouts: 25,340<br />
Location: USA</p>
<p>Here are some players wearing Sheeppie&#8217;s military trench coat, body armor and clan uniform.<br />
<img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-6604" title="Military trenchcoat" src="http://community.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/12/c2780f041ce4a5c5cea44d30506d607e.png" alt="Military trenchcoat" width="150" height="200" /><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-6606" title="Armor" src="http://community.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/12/3a4b2529afdf87c10d88dbd031fff74a.png" alt="Armor" width="150" height="200" /><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-6605" title="Uniform" src="http://community.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/12/eb3dc9669625c638f9f3f5ae54d7f4e3.png" alt="Uniform" width="150" height="200" /><!-- PHP 5.x --></p>
<div class='wpfblike' ><fb:like href='http://community.roblox.com/archives/6603' layout='default' show_faces='false' width='400' action='like' colorscheme='light' send='false' /></div>					</div><!-- .entry-content -->
		
		<footer class="entry-meta">
												<span class="cat-links">
				<span class="entry-utility-prep entry-utility-prep-cat-links">Posted in</span> <a href="http://community.roblox.com/archives/category/news" title="View all posts in News" rel="category tag">News</a>, <a href="http://community.roblox.com/archives/category/news/reports-from-robloxia" title="View all posts in Reports From Robloxia" rel="category tag">Reports From Robloxia</a>			</span>
									
									<span class="sep"> | </span>
						<span class="comments-link"><a href="http://community.roblox.com/archives/6603#respond" title="Comment on Meet an Interesting ROBLOXian: Sheeppie"><span class="leave-reply">Leave a reply</span></a></span>
			
					</footer><!-- #entry-meta -->
	</article><!-- #post-6603 -->

				
					
	<article id="post-6581" class="post-6581 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-news">
		<header class="entry-header">
						<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="http://community.roblox.com/archives/6581" title="Permalink to Best Items of 2011" rel="bookmark">Best Items of 2011</a></h1>
			
						<div class="entry-meta">
				<span class="by-author"><span class="sep"> By </span> <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="http://community.roblox.com/archives/author/brighteyes" title="View all posts by BrightEyes" rel="author">BrightEyes</a></span></span> - <time class="entry-date" datetime="2011-12-24T22:36:36+00:00" pubdate>December 24, 2011</time>			</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
			
					</header><!-- .entry-header -->

				<div class="entry-content">
			<p><a href="http://community.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/12/blog.png"  rel="lightbox[6581]" title="blog"><img src="http://community.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/12/blog.png" alt="" title="blog" width="500" height="236" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-6582" /></a><br />
ROBLOX is going to end 2011 with a bang … and a slash, and a pow! Beginning on December 25th and continuing until December 31st, we’ll be releasing our hottest items of the year – 6 new gear items, 5 new bodies, and tons of new hats. Here’s your sneak peak of some of our favorites–</p>
<p><strong>The Tempest Blades</strong> – The absolute raw power of two of ROBLOX’s strongest blades is now yours.<br />
<strong>Korblox Sword and Shield</strong> – The evil Korblox are back with the baddest Sword and Shield set you have ever seen. Will you join the dark side?<br />
<strong>All Seeing Sentry</strong> – The all-seeing sentry attacks your opponents so you don’t have to! This will be available to BC members only.<br />
<strong>The Spectral Sword of Illusions</strong> – This futuristic items will have your opponents seeing double. Because there will be at least two of you attacking them!<br />
<strong>The Deluxe Swordpack</strong> – A deluxe version of the most favorited hat in ROBLOX history. It can be yours for just 200 R$.<br />
<strong>Captain Zombie</strong> – He be plunderin’ the coast lookin’ for BRAAAINS!</p>
<p>Keep your eye on <a href="/p/Catalog.aspx" >the catalog</a> – we’ll be adding exciting new items every day! <!-- PHP 5.x --></p>
<div class='wpfblike' ><fb:like href='http://community.roblox.com/archives/6581' layout='default' show_faces='false' width='400' action='like' colorscheme='light' send='false' /></div>					</div><!-- .entry-content -->
		
		<footer class="entry-meta">
												<span class="cat-links">
				<span class="entry-utility-prep entry-utility-prep-cat-links">Posted in</span> <a href="http://community.roblox.com/archives/category/news" title="View all posts in News" rel="category tag">News</a>			</span>
									
			
					</footer><!-- #entry-meta -->
	</article><!-- #post-6581 -->

				
